  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "こっちが果穂で──これとこれが樹里ちゃん、\r\n凛世ちゃんにはこれで、夏葉ちゃんは──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──すごい量のお菓子だな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん！\r\nお疲れ様ですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ……\r\nちょっと張りきって買いすぎちゃいましたかね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "感謝祭も無事に終わったので",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "放課後クライマックスガールズのみんなを筆頭とした\r\n関係各位に──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "かたちばかりではありますが、チョコアイドルから\r\n何かお贈りできれば──と思ったんですが",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……へぇ、みんな違うお菓子なのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そうなんです！　この機会だし、いつかみんなに\r\nおすすめするぞ～！　って思ってたものにしてて",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "チョコアイドルの目利き品ってわけだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そこまですごい感じではないですが……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──……私の『チョコアイドル』って、みんなが\r\n受け入れてくれてるからこそのキャラだと思うんですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんもそう、ユニットのみんなもそう、\r\nファンのみんなもそう、スタッフさんもそう……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "たくさんの方が、チョコアイドルでいいよって\r\n言ってくれるから……成り立ってるんだよなぁって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "それってとってもありがたいことだし、\r\n恵まれてることじゃないですか！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "感謝祭もあって、\r\n改めてそういうことに気付かせてもらったので……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "忘れないうちに気持ちを表現、というやつです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いい心がけだな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへー、褒められちゃいました……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──そんなプロデューサーさんには、\r\nこちらです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、俺ももらっていいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えー……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "逆に、さっきの話で、どうして\r\nプロデューサーさんの分はないって思うんですか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ユニットのみんなの分と一緒に、\r\n真っ先に用意してるんですからねっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……\r\nなんか悪いな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020200,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もー、悪くなんかないんですっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020210,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "一番お礼を伝えたい人なんですから、\r\nもっと堂々とお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020220,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020230,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──それでは改めまして、\r\nいつもありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020240,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……ということで、といったらアレなんですが",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010002020250,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "この後お菓子を配りに行くの、\r\n手伝っていただけたら嬉しいな、なんて！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000202/1010002020250"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]